# Simpan semua file teks di repo dengan line ending LF.
# Git otomatis memakai CRLF di working tree Windows bila core.autocrlf=true,
# jadi diff tidak lagi membengkak karena perbedaan line ending antaranggota.
* text=auto

# File biner: jangan pernah diubah line ending-nya.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.sqlite3 binary
